  "description": "ShadowDusk's MonoGame content-pipeline importer and processor (ShadowDuskEffectImporter / ShadowDuskEffectProcessor) as a normal library, for MonoGame 3.8.5's code-centric Content Builder project: reference the package, pass the two instances in GetContentCollection, and your .fx compiles to .xnb through ShadowDusk in your Builder's own process, with no mgfxc, no fxc.exe, and no Wine. A delivery shape of the ShadowDusk compiler library - byte-for-byte the .mgfx the ShadowDusk CLI emits. For .mgcb / MGCB use ShadowDusk.MgcbPlugin instead.",
